WEBVTT

00:00:57.512 --> 00:01:04.477
The question is: Are we smart enough
to survive how smart we are?

00:01:06.687 --> 00:01:10.191
It's not looking so good just now, is it?

00:01:10.191 --> 00:01:11.734
(Laughter)

00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:16.114
We stand facing the possibility
of global conflict.

00:01:16.114 --> 00:01:17.740
If that happens,

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:20.827
it will be our Third World War

00:01:20.868 --> 00:01:24.163
in not much more than 100 years.

00:01:25.623 --> 00:01:32.046
If Putin's violence stops today,
the problem doesn't go away.